      "side": 1,
      "message": "Grzegorz, Thank you for your review. I double check the logs of original issue, STOP message is received when state machine is in CONFIGURED state(after create BIG). \n\n1. CreateAudioBroadcast -\u003e enable announcement -\u003e OnCreateAnnouncement-\u003e state machine CONFIGURED state\n2. StartAudioBroadcast -\u003e message START is received in CONFIGURED state -\u003e Create BIG\n3. message STOP is received in CONFIGURED state -\u003e disable announcement -\u003e OnCreateAnnouncement -\u003e state machine STOPPED state\n4. DestroyAudioBroadcast\n5. BIG create complete event is received\n\n\nI think this issue scenario has already be handled by below two changes:\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3247473\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3505858\n\n\nI will abandon my fix in Java part.",
